{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":35068,\"title\":\"Murphy's War\",\"tagline\":\"World War Two was just ending. World War Murphy is about to begin.\",\"overview\":\"Murphy is the sole survivor of his crew, that has been massacred by a German U-Boat in the closing days of World War II. He is rescued, and ends up at a forgotten mission station near the mouth of the Orinoco, and begins to plot his vengeance. He wishes to sink the U-Boat by means of any method imaginable to him, and sets about to make the courageous attempt, assisted by Louis, the administrator of the local oil company.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dXTJJj5C7usHjI9gOEvzA2Jzlmq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pstKL6eLcraGnR91CYlxaLfkuxW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"voteCount\":103,\"year\":1971,\"runtime\":107,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"code\":\"VE\",\"name\":\"Venezuela\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Peter Yates\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":12804,\"name\":\"Peter Yates\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sHcC917Y0F7UoaVAnF2yKMvUnSn.jpg\"},{\"id\":11390,\"name\":\"Peter O'Toole\",\"character\":\"Murphy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fElkV2pyiPfmvyhLUllKpyhG7L3.jpg\"},{\"id\":12522,\"name\":\"Siân Phillips\",\"character\":\"Hayden\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k2OIQZUWLTlZYfHjpS5X8csYbSY.jpg\"},{\"id\":24366,\"name\":\"Philippe Noiret\",\"character\":\"Brezan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mWPa6A0JK3tfVRQDIzCQGEao19B.jpg\"},{\"id\":100095,\"name\":\"Horst Janson\",\"character\":\"Lauchs\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hUIETgOLN9nxpgw47POzpJmk5Oa.jpg\"},{\"id\":12690,\"name\":\"John Hallam\",\"character\":\"Ellis\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tKeHNESlAuV7EWMSd1uVF3BFCyX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1046080,\"name\":\"Ingo Mogendorf\",\"character\":\"Voght\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o8kaJ2EK5nRhxOJrgtDdHGy8LeC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1208787,\"name\":\"John Clifford\",\"character\":\"German Submarine Crewman (uncredited)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":202402,\"name\":\"Harry Fielder\",\"character\":\"German Submarine Crewman (uncredited)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":110319,\"name\":\"George Roubicek\",\"character\":\"German Submarine Crewman (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5b1RBUYtSVPXWDFHTO7Wun9IXKy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1166842,\"name\":\"Bob Simmons\",\"character\":\"German Submarine Crewman (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r8FFHcp0a9VNCpR14S22SNIzLBK.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1422041,\"title\":\"LA BOLA NEGRA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7HwFQTMghL6HOvzEnXYUvyuZXeh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bDsmYvrzto7xrEwqDpLC3SPhn9A.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The intertwined lives of three men in three different eras, three lives intimately linked by sexuality and desire, pain, and legacy.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":872585,\"title\":\"Oppenheimer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer's role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16869,\"title\":\"Inglourious Basterds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aupnPtagH9JVBuMrGEanf4iqXEQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bMJxwgLyD47CDQ6BFCT2AMMlID7.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Nazi-occupied France during World War II, a group of Jewish-American soldiers known as \\\"The Basterds\\\" are chosen specifically to spread fear throughout the Third Reich by scalping and brutally killing Nazis. The Basterds, lead by Lt. Aldo Raine soon cross paths with a French-Jewish teenage girl who runs a movie theater in Paris which is targeted by the soldiers.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":324786,\"title\":\"Hacksaw Ridge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnOMP6mjmOmZwmlC1n0K7ivrzt1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vDKRMZGFTKP9nQolzeSB1rB1w6p.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"WWII American Army Medic Desmond T. Doss, who served during the Battle of Okinawa, refuses to kill people and becomes the first Conscientious Objector in American history to receive the Congressional Medal of Honor.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":423,\"title\":\"The Pianist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2hFvxCCWrTmCYwfy7yum0GKRi3Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c0fB9xk7D1aVb3Bg2rk2SVJcGn.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman's experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":228150,\"title\":\"Fury\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/95ckrV6wQgbffurAVmETQ5YKASL.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"April, 1945. As the Allies make their final push in the European Theater, a battle-hardened army sergeant commands a Sherman tank with a five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":205596,\"title\":\"The Imitation Game\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSqJ1qFq8NXFfi7JeIYMlzyR0dx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8FCHJ21JBQOgATY2WI8vwYAiXg8.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on the real life story of legendary cryptanalyst Alan Turing, the film portrays the nail-biting race against time by Turing and his brilliant team of code-breakers at Britain's top-secret Government Code and Cypher School at Bletchley Park, during the darkest days of World War II.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1495,\"title\":\"Kingdom of Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1417,\"title\":\"Pan's Labyrinth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/khBQ6nN5FLfg9XgPXIZDkABJjqo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6G6nqSW9S7EHA9HrYl0Z8uo2H7f.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In post–civil war Spain, 10-year-old Ofelia moves with her pregnant mother to live under the control of her cruel stepfather. Drawn into a mysterious labyrinth, she meets a faun who reveals that she may be a lost princess from an underground kingdom. To return to her true father, she must complete a series of surreal and perilous tasks that blur the line between reality and fantasy.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":616,\"title\":\"The Last Samurai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a8jmJPs5eZBARmnuEEvZwbjwyz4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lm15lu2jt3I3Syxsb90UJzUzMRV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nathan Algren is an American hired to instruct the Japanese army in the ways of modern warfare, which finds him learning to respect the samurai and the honorable principles that rule them. Pressed to destroy the samurai's way of life in the name of modernization and open trade, Algren decides to become an ultimate warrior himself and to fight for their right to exist.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":530915,\"title\":\"1917\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2lBOQK06tltt8SQaswgb8d657Mv.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49046,\"title\":\"All Quiet on the Western Front\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2IRjbi9cADuDMKmHdLK7LaqQDKA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xBwtP27cx8WfjHJVFkpuV6F1RES.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Paul Baumer and his friends Albert and Muller, egged on by romantic dreams of heroism, voluntarily enlist in the German army. Full of excitement and patriotic fervour, the boys enthusiastically march into a war they believe in. But once on the Western Front, they discover the soul-destroying horror of World War I.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"lWdp7KWZnCY\",\"name\":\"Original Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}